          "text": "The user household explicitly established taking shared decisions in turns. Wishes, plans, hypotheses, questions, another household and missing information do not establish or deny this agreement. Check the proposed boolean and exact pair scope. Explicit refusal or an explicit statement that no agreement was reached supports false. Preserve the exact stated scope. A positive agreement for one pair does not prove a negative agreement for another pair. Non-applicability to another pair means unknown for that pair, not explicit false; false requires an explicit denial for the same scope.",
